      A great fabric and a perfect cut can be ruined by a flimsy zipper, a label that scratches the neck, or a button that falls off after one wash. Trims are the details customers notice when they hold and wear the garment.
    </p>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Premium fashion brands invest in high-quality trims because they signal craftsmanship. A YKK zipper feels different from a generic zipper. A woven label feels different from a printed label. Custom care labels with your brand language signal you care about the customer experience.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

