        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Can I order trims without ordering garments from SDF?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. Our trims sourcing is a standalone service. You can order labels, tags, buttons, or any other trim component for delivery to your own factory or warehouse anywhere in the world.</p>
