      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does it take to develop custom-branded trims?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Stock trims ship in 5-10 days. Custom-printed trims take 10-20 days. Custom-woven labels and custom-molded buttons take 20-35 days for first production including mold setup. Repeat orders of approved trims take 10-20 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do trims need to match my garment fabric for sustainability claims?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">For GOTS organic certification, trims must also be GOTS certified. For GRS recycled claims, trim recycled content matters. For OEKO-TEX chemical safety, all trims and fabric should be OEKO-TEX certified for the cleanest claim.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the cost of custom-printed labels?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Custom-printed satin or cotton labels typically cost $0.05-0.15 per label in bulk quantities of 1,000+ pieces. Custom-woven labels cost $0.10-0.30 per label. Costs include mold or screen setup amortized over first order.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Can you source YKK zippers?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We source genuine YKK zippers in any length, color, weight, and configuration. YKK is the global premium zipper standard for fashion brands.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you handle care label content for different markets?</h3>
